{"id":"steroids-lipids","name":"Steroids/Lipids","color":"#9ecf5a","center":{"x":-42.1,"y":-51,"z":-156.61},"molecules":[{"id":"pubchem-5281","name":"Stearic Acid","smiles":"CCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCC(=O)O","molecularWeight":284.5,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-42.13,"y":-51.31,"z":-159.62},"cid":5281,"fact":"硬脂酸像巧克力的支架，能讓可可脂在室溫下維持固態。巧克力師會調整它與其他脂肪酸的比例，讓熔點接近體溫，才造就入口即化的巧克力。","factCategory":"food_sensory","factSourceTitle":"Advances in cocoa butter and alternative fats: composition and crystallization dynamics in chocolate production","factSourceUrl":"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00217-026-05046-3","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5754","name":"Cortisol","smiles":"CC12CCC(=O)C=C1CCC3C2C(CC4(C3CCC4(C(=O)CO)O)C)O","molecularWeight":362.5,"hbd":3,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-52.08,"y":-57.98,"z":-148.38},"cid":5754,"fact":"皮質醇不只在壓力大時出場；早晨醒來後 30 到 45 分鐘，它通常會快速上升，像身體內建的起床鈴。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"The Cortisol Awakening Response","factSourceUrl":"https://www.endocrine.org/journals/endocrine-reviews/the-cortisol-awakening-response","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5997","name":"Cholesterol","smiles":"CC(C)CCCC(C)C1CCC2C1(CCC3C2CC=C4C3(CCC(C4)O)C)C","molecularWeight":386.7,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-41.67,"y":-45.49,"z":-166.8},"cid":5997,"fact":"膽固醇常被當成壞角色，身體卻少不了它：每個細胞膜都要用，還拿它製造維生素 D 與多種荷爾蒙。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Biochemistry, Cholesterol","factSourceUrl":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK513326/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-1107","name":"Sterols","smiles":"C1CC2CCC3C4CCC(CC4CCC3C2C1)O","molecularWeight":248.4,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-37.98,"y":-49.78,"z":-157.64},"cid":1107},{"id":"pubchem-6013","name":"Testosterone","smiles":"CC12CCC3C(C1CCC2O)CCC4=CC(=O)CCC34C","molecularWeight":288.4,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-49.68,"y":-55.98,"z":-151.9},"cid":6013,"fact":"睪固酮不是男性專屬；女性也會製造。進入不同組織後，它甚至能換上另一種荷爾蒙身分，變成雌二醇，一種主要的雌激素。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Metabolic benefits afforded by estradiol and testosterone in both sexes: clinical considerations","factSourceUrl":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39225098/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5757","name":"Estradiol","smiles":"CC12CCC3C(C1CCC2O)CCC4=C3C=CC(=C4)O","molecularWeight":272.4,"hbd":2,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-40.82,"y":-50.68,"z":-157.85},"cid":5757,"fact":"雌二醇也不是女性專屬：男性會把一部分睪固酮轉成它，骨骼維持強健也需要這一步。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Metabolic benefits afforded by estradiol and testosterone in both sexes: clinical considerations","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11364390/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5994","name":"Progesterone","smiles":"CC(=O)C1CCC2C1(CCC3C2CCC4=CC(=O)CCC34C)C","molecularWeight":314.5,"hbd":0,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-50.51,"y":-52.45,"z":-160.11},"cid":5994,"fact":"黃體酮不只存在人體與動物；科學家在番茄、馬鈴薯、蘋果、稻米和洋蔥等植物中，也找到了微量的黃體酮。","factCategory":"environment","factSourceTitle":"Progesterone: Its occurrence in plants and involvement in plant growth","factSourceUrl":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0031942207002221","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-638072","name":"Squalene","smiles":"CC(=CCCC(=CCCC(=CCCC=C(C)CCC=C(C)CCC=C(C)C)C)C)C","molecularWeight":410.7,"hbd":0,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-50.52,"y":-48.75,"z":-165.2},"cid":638072,"fact":"角鯊烯因最早從鯊魚肝油分離而得名，但你的皮膚也會製造它，約占皮膚表面脂質的一成。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Squalene: More than a Step toward Sterols","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7464659/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5280795","name":"Vitamin D3","smiles":"CC(C)CCCC(C)C1CCC2C1(CCCC2=CC=C3CC(CCC3=C)O)C","molecularWeight":384.6,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-52.4,"y":-52.94,"z":-164.91},"cid":5280795,"fact":"皮膚能用陽光製造維生素 D3，隔著窗戶曬卻不行：需要的 UVB 會被玻璃擋住。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Vitamin D - Health Professional Fact Sheet","factSourceUrl":"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Vitamind-HealthProfessional/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-445639","name":"Oleic Acid","smiles":"CCCCCCCCC=CCCCCCCCC(=O)O","molecularWeight":282.5,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-42.21,"y":-50.83,"z":-156.73},"cid":445639,"fact":"油酸不只待在橄欖油瓶裡；皮膚也會製造它，並用它喚起天然抗菌防線，協助阻擋細菌在皮膚上過度生長。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Sebum Free Fatty Acids Enhance the Innate Immune Defense of Human Sebocytes by Upregulating Beta-Defensin-2 Expression","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3057125/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5280450","name":"Linoleic Acid","smiles":"CCCCCC=CCC=CCCCCCCCC(=O)O","molecularWeight":280.4,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-41.26,"y":-50.18,"z":-149.43},"cid":5280450,"fact":"人體做不出亞油酸，只能從食物取得。皮膚拿到它後，會砌成一道防止水分溜走的保護牆；缺少時，皮膚便容易乾燥脫屑。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"The Role of Linoleic Acid in Skin and Hair Health: A Review","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11719646/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5280934","name":"Alpha-Linolenic Acid","smiles":"CCC=CCC=CCC=CCCCCCCCC(=O)O","molecularWeight":278.4,"hbd":1,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-42.77,"y":-48.84,"z":-156.09},"cid":5280934,"fact":"Omega-3 不只來自魚類：α-亞麻酸也是 omega-3 家族的一員，亞麻籽與奇亞籽就富含它。只是人體能把它轉成 EPA、DHA 的比例不到 15%。","factCategory":"food_sensory","factSourceTitle":"Omega-3 Fatty Acids - Health Professional Fact Sheet","factSourceUrl":"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Omega3FattyAcids-HealthProfessional/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-444899","name":"Arachidonic Acid","smiles":"CCCCCC=CCC=CCC=CCC=CCCCC(=O)O","molecularWeight":304.5,"hbd":1,"rec